#### Technical Notes
Export workflow:
```typescript
// In Animation.ts
exportSVG(): string {
  const svg = document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg', 'svg');
  svg.setAttribute('viewBox', '0 0 600 200');

  this.elements.forEach(element => {
    const elementSVG = element.toSVG();
    svg.appendChild(elementSVG);
  });

  return svg.outerHTML;
}
```

Test files to create:
- `gallery/test-exports/logo-line-drawing.svg` - exported SVG
- `gallery/test-exports/test.html` - HTML to load and verify SVG

